@startuml sd_us115a
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US115a - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Maintenance Technician" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "MaintenanceController" as MaintenanceController
participant "CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase" as CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== POST /api/maintenance/records ==
Actor -> EAM : POST /api/maintenance/records\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> MaintenanceController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
MaintenanceController -> CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase : execute(...)
CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase -> DBAM : aircraft here?
opt not found here
CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/aircrafts/{registration}\n(asks the peers)
PAM --> CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase : 200 / 404
end
CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase -> DBAM : maintenance templates (catalog, complete here)
CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase -> DBAM : maintenance parts (catalog, complete here)
CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase -> DBAM : save maintenance record + copy for the next replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
CreateMaintenanceRecordUseCase --> MaintenanceController : created
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/maintenance-records\n(to the next replica in the ring, retried until delivered)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
